    "detailed_description": "\u201cPasha Planet: Reborn\u201d is the debut game of Scorpio Game, a Taiwanese indie game development studio. Prepare to be charmed by unique hand-painted scenes and have fun with light detective work, players will get to explore the main game plot that revolves around the characters\u2019 daily life through an immersive and one-of-a-kind puzzle-solving gameplay.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Game Overview]</h2>The story takes place on the distant planet of Pasha. A prosperous underground city, which are inhabited by adorable doggies, can be found there. They live in peace day after day, enjoying the convenience brought about by technology. However, the protagonist Bobbie, who grew up in the city, often fantasizes about getting out of the closed-off Underground City to see the world outside. This is where the main story line of the game begins.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>Players will take on the role of Bobbie and explore the seemingly calm and peaceful city, which is in actual fact, facing an energy crisis. Players must clear stages of challenges to solve the final mystery and figure out a way to save all the inhabitants before disaster strikes!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Game Features]</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Created by an indie game development studio in Taiwan.<br></li><li> Classic click-and-point puzzle-solving gameplay.<br></li><li> Charming and heartwarming hand-painted scenes.<br></li><li> Challenging puzzles and stages.</li></ul>",
